# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials and key material
#
# NOTE: `.env` / `*.env` are deliberately NOT ignored. Задания 2, 3 and 7 all
# require a committed Env file holding *demonstration* values, and a blanket
# ignore here would silently drop a graded deliverable. Real credentials must
# therefore never be written into those files — use the `.local` variants below,
# or the secret stores from задание 6.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.local.env
secrets.*
!secrets.example.*
*.pem
*.key
!**/testdata/*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*.ppk
.netrc
.pgpass
.vault-token
vault-data/
vault/file/
.infisical.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SAST / DAST scratch state (задания 8–10)
#
# Generated databases and working dirs only. Report artefacts (*.sarif, *.html,
# *.json exports) are graded deliverables and stay tracked.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
codeql-db/
*-codeql-db/
.codeql/
.scannerwork/
.sonar/
.semgrep/
.semgrepignore.cache
zap-session/
*.session
.zap/
gosec-report.tmp
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/

